Z||000005||Ken Wittlief||06-29-2001||10:12 AM||||Geeze - donor for a kit car maybe?<P>the thing has never been run at all - not good for any of the metal internal parts.<P>in storage for 15 years - how long till dryrot takes its toll on tires, hoses, belts, bushings, engine mounts, the padding in the seat, weatherstripping...<P>if the motor and tranny are not rusted up inside then it could be a good base for a kit car. - If you want a kit car with an auto tranny...<P>  I think he might get $3k for it? maybe $4k?||||reg||1
