Z||000010||Formula88||06-29-2001||05:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Mera's were only the 1988 model year. This car was purchased in Feb of 87. Mera's were not available until September.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank you!  So even if you could get a Mera in the Fall of 87 (88 model year), no "kits" were available yet, because most every Ferrari kit was molded from the Mera.  So this story smells like a lot of bunk.  Thanks for the dates.  I was thinking it was '88 only, but I figured even if it was 87, that's still too late.||||reg||1
